  "description": "A laboratory filled with nothing but chaos and silence, devoid of any warmth. \\[BU-001 Experiment Commencing.\\] All Hui-Su wants is death.\n\n*“I don’t want to live anymore...”*\n\nOne day, Seung-Hyeon, the ideal guide, appears before Hui-S, a Sentinel who has become so numb from heartless, painful acts and unwanted experiments that he can no longer feel pain or even emotions.\n\n*“So it’s you, my guide.”*\n\nUnlike the other violent guides, Seung-Hyeon treats Hui-Su with care, as if he were a fragile being, and watching him, Hu-Su begins to feel a strange emotion he’s never experienced before...\n\n*“I’ll always be by your side, so rest easy, Yeomyeong.”\n\n\"Hui-Su... Not Yeomyeong—Hu-Su. Do Hui-Su.”*\n\nWith Seung-Hyeon’s arrival, colors begin to be added one by one to Hui-Su’s life, which had always been like a black-and-white film.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
